.TH "Docv::ViewerSettings" "3cr" "2026-11-03" "docv 0.1.0" "docv API Reference"
.SH "NAME"
Docv::ViewerSettings \- Viewer settings from \fB\%[viewer]\fR: the \fIdock\fR style, its width in columns (\fIdock_width\fR), whether it is open at start (\fIdock_open\fR), and the threads that read and search the text of all pages (\fIsearch_threads\fR; 0 is one less than the processor count).
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBrequire "docv"\fR
.sp
\fBstruct Docv::ViewerSettings\fR
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.PP
Viewer settings from \fB\%[viewer]\fR: the \fIdock\fR style, its width in columns
(\fIdock_width\fR), whether it is open at start (\fIdock_open\fR), and the
threads that read and search the text of all pages (\fIsearch_threads\fR;
0 is one less than the processor count).
.SH "CONSTRUCTORS"
.PP
\fBdef self.new(dock : DockStyle = DockStyle::Regular, dock_width : Int32 = 36, dock_open : Bool = false, search_threads : Int32 = 0)\fR
.SH "INSTANCE METHODS"
.PP
\fBdef dock : DockStyle\fR
.PP
\fBdef dock_open : Bool\fR
.PP
\fBdef dock_width : Int32\fR
.PP
\fBdef search_threads : Int32\fR
